Servotronics (NYSE:SVT [https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SVT]) +23.1% pre-market Thursday after saying TransDigm (NYSE:TDG [https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/TDG]) increased [https://seekingalpha.com/pr/20119868-servotronics-executes-amendment-to-the-agreement-and-plan-of-merger-with-transdigm] its tender offer price to acquire the company to $47/share in cash from $38.50/share in cash;
